se between Raw Input on Windows or Steam Input.<br></li><li>Hone your skills in the ultra customizable practice mode!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience the epic conclusion of Toaplan's legendary shooter series with Batsugun including the lauded Special version! Choose your favorite character and spaceship in this thrilling genre-defining bullet-hell action. Now on PC with modern enhancements!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cA pixel-perfect, feature-rich port of Toaplan's last shooter for less than eight bucks? Shoot 'em fans should rejoice.\u201d<br>80% \u2013 Tech-Gaming<br><br>\u201cA blast to play on Steam Deck.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 TouchArcade<br><br>\u201cFans of the genre will find a game that absolutely holds up and is a blast to play even today\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Hey Poor Player<br>",
